Spec: SpecDD Language Identity

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Define the IntelliJ language identity for SpecDD files.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDLanguage.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDLanguage.kt

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDLanguageBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Expose a singleton `Language` instance for SpecDD.
  Use `SpecDD` as the IntelliJ language id.
  Be shared by file type, parser definition, PSI file, and code style support.
  Stay independent from highlighting and validation behavior.

Must not:
  Define file type metadata.
  Define parser behavior.
  Define code style settings.
  Define highlighting or validation behavior.
